00:18:42.579 --> 00:18:43.914
THESE CRIMES AT A TIME WHEN CALIFORNIA HAD ONLY JUST

00:18:43.914 --> 00:18:46.914
ENACTED ITS HATE CRIME STATUTE .

00:18:46.917 --> 00:18:50.454
