00:19:31.162 --> 00:19:34.431
A PERPETRATOR TO VICTIMIZE ANY ONE INDIVIDUAL OR BUSINESS

00:19:34.431 --> 00:19:38.452
SOLELY BUT RATHER TO INSTILL FEAR IN ENTIRE COMMUNITIES.

00:19:38.452 --> 00:19:42.122
